WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:01.601
[engine revving]

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:04.537
[suspenseful music]

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:07.707
MARIANA VAN ZELLER: In my quest
to expose how American guns are

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:11.211
trafficked throughout
Mexico, I never expected

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:13.513
to be headed out to sea.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.182
But as we move deeper
into the waters,

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:20.587
these smugglers break
down their operation.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:24.124
The Sea of Cortez is
over 700 miles long

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.459
but less than 100 miles wide.

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:29.429
That means these smugglers
can make the crossing in less

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:32.499
than three hours,
completely bypassing

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:36.569
the military checkpoints set
up along Mexico's highways.

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:38.671
Right now, they say
they're delivering

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:43.042
more and more guns to Sonora
directly across the sea.

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:44.978
That's the same
heavily contested

00:00:45.044 --> 00:00:47.914
territory that
Hector in Mexicali

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.791
is also sending guns to.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.154
I think we're-- that's it.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.523
I think we're going to
that beach over there.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.558
Oh, there were some guys there.

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:00.427
There are some guys actually
waiting at the beach.

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:02.562
Or at least one
guy that I see now.

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:04.764
And he's coming
to greet the boat.

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:09.235
He's all dressed in black
with a mask, as well.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:11.304
Yeah, they're anchoring
right there so this is it.

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:21.314
I'm told the man in black is
another buyer from Sonora.

00:01:21.381 --> 00:01:24.751
[suspenseful music]

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:29.122
Hola.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:30.356
CARTEL MEMBER:
[speaking spanish]

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:31.491
MARIANA VAN ZELLER:
